# BATTERY ECO: the fuel-saver. The reactor runs the ECO core (just hot enough for the load: temperature = turbine/2 + 8,
# at least 12 degrees, so about a quarter less fission and fuel) and the batteries are what makes that safe: a sudden
# load is covered from the batteries while the core heats up (reactor_modes alone browns out there). Charge target is 70 %.
name battery_eco
box battery
note "BATTERY BOX: HOW IT WORKS" "Keeps the batteries near 60 % so they can soak up surplus AND cover dips (a full battery can't absorb anything).\nDemand = grid load - battery charging (charge rate % x total recharge).\nError = 60 - charge %. The reactor is asked for demand + error x recharge/50 (at most +/- half the recharge): more when the batteries are low, less when they are high.\nIt only asks for less than demand by what the batteries really deliver (+50 kW), so disabled or empty batteries never cause a brownout.\nSurplus = reactor output - demand goes into the batteries: set_rate = surplus / total recharge.\nIt keeps battery output enabled (disable_output 0)."
note "WIRING" "in1 charge_%, in2 charge_rate, in7 power_value_out (from ONE battery)\nin3 main junction box load_value_out, in6 reactor power_value_out\nout1 set_rate and out3 disable_output -> EVERY battery\nout2 -> reactor box in8"
pin in1 battery.charge_%
pin in2 battery.charge_rate
pin in3 junction.load_value_out
pin in6 reactor.power_value_out
pin in7 battery.power_value_out
pin out1 battery.set_rate
pin out3 battery.disable_output
c kb mem Value=$BATT_KW
c k100 mem Value=100
c chg mul                     # charge_rate% * BATT_KW
c chgk div                    # / 100 -> charging kW
c dem sub                     # grid load - charging = demand
c ktgt mem Value=70           # target charge %
c err sub                     # 60 - charge%
c kg mem Value=$BATT_KW/50    # gain: kW of bias per 1% of charge error
c bias mul ClampMin=-$BATT_KW/2 ClampMax=$BATT_KW/2
c setp add                    # demand + bias -> reactor setpoint
c sur sub                     # reactor output - demand = surplus
c rate div                    # surplus / BATT_KW
c pct mul ClampMin=0 ClampMax=100   # -> set_rate %
c kn mem Value=$BATT_N
c bo mul                      # one battery's output * battery count = kW the batteries give
c k50 mem Value=50
c allow0 add                  # + 50
c km1 mem Value=-1
c allow mul                   # -(given + 50): the lowest bias the batteries can back up
c d1 sub                      # max(bias, allow) = (bias + allow + |bias - allow|) / 2
c ad abs
c s1 add
c s2 add
c k2 mem Value=2
c bmax div
c k0 mem Value=0              # keep battery output enabled
w in2 chg.1
w kb.out chg.2 rate.2
w chg.out chgk.1
w k100.out chgk.2 pct.2
w in3 dem.1
w chgk.out dem.2
w dem.out setp.1 sur.2
w ktgt.out err.1
w in1 err.2
w err.out bias.1
w kg.out bias.2
w in7 bo.1
w kn.out bo.2
w bo.out allow0.1
w k50.out allow0.2
w allow0.out allow.1
w km1.out allow.2
w bias.out d1.1 s1.1
w allow.out d1.2 s1.2
w d1.out ad.in
w s1.out s2.1
w ad.out s2.2
w s2.out bmax.1
w k2.out bmax.2
w bmax.out setp.2
w k0.out out3
w setp.out out2
w in6 sur.1
w sur.out rate.1
w rate.out pct.1
w pct.out out1
box reactor
note "ECO REACTOR BOX: HOW IT WORKS (17 parts)" "Makes what the battery box asks for (in8, kW). Turbine = setpoint / max x 100.\nTarget temperature = actual turbine / 2 + 8, between 12 and 57: just enough output cap (temperature / 50) for the turbine, which burns far less fuel than holding 50.\nFission = (actual turbine + 2 x target - temperature) x 50 / fuel.\nThe batteries cover any jump the cool core cannot make yet.\nTurn the reactor's automatic control OFF."
note "WIRING" "From the reactor: in2 power_value_out, in3 temperature_out, in4 fuel_out\nin8 <- battery box out2\nout1 -> set_fissionrate, out2 -> set_turbineoutput"
c tdiv div
c tmax mem Value=$MAX
c tpct mul ClampMin=0 ClampMax=100
c k100 mem Value=100
c pdiv div
c ppct mul
c tdeg div
c k05 mem Value=0.5
c eco1 mul
c k8 mem Value=8
c eco add ClampMin=12 ClampMax=57
c k2 mem Value=2
c t2 mul
c f1 add
c f2 sub
c k50 mem Value=50
c fmul mul
c fdiv div ClampMin=0 ClampMax=100
w in8 tdiv.1
w tmax.out tdiv.2 pdiv.2
w tdiv.out tpct.1
w k100.out tpct.2 ppct.2 tdeg.2
w tpct.out out2
w in2 pdiv.1
w pdiv.out ppct.1
w ppct.out f1.1 eco1.1
w in3 tdeg.1
w k05.out eco1.2
w eco1.out eco.1
w k8.out eco.2
w eco.out t2.1
w k2.out t2.2
w t2.out f1.2
w f1.out f2.1
w tdeg.out f2.2
w f2.out fmul.1
w k50.out fmul.2
w fmul.out fdiv.1
w in4 fdiv.2
w fdiv.out out1
link battery.out2 reactor.in8
